<!-- Status-bar / notification-shade icon. Android renders this as a flat
     white silhouette on Android 5+ regardless of the fillColor below, so it
     must be a simple transparent-background shape — NOT the multi-layer,
     full-color adaptive launcher icon (@mipmap/ic_launcher), which either
     renders as a solid white/gray block or is rejected in the notification
     shade. Reuses the app's heart mark from
     drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml. -->
